      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEAT THE BANK (8) finished fifth at this track two runs ago before finishing fifth at his latest appearance over 2569m at Bunbury, beaten 16 metres. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. Tackles a similar assignment and he can turn in a much better performance. POCKET THE CHANGE NZ (1) turned in a much better run last start, finishing fourth over 2503m here. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Won't find this any harder and she can go right on with the job. TRUE GRIT NZ (3) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished third at this circuit over 2130m. Include in calculations. BEYOND BLING (7) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish second at Narrogin over 2662m. One for the exotics players.",
